[h1] Roadmap

[p] Potentially coming features:


[h2] Done
[p] - Icon buttons in search bar
[p] - back and forward navigation up to 10 steps
[p] - 404 page
[p] - inline links
[p] - webrings
[p] - custom colors
[p] - comments
[p] - bugfix: comment section did scroll behind the url search bar
[p] - grids

[h2] animated images

[p-]
Allow images to have multiple image sources and a frame rate so that animations can be played.
[-p]

[h2] clickable images

[p-]
Clickable images that navigate to another page when clicked.
[-p]

[h2] Embedded Audio (autoplay on page or with a tag)

[p-]
Add a tag like "[audio src=...]" which will display a audio player
[-p]

[h2] Basic scripting

[p-]
Minimal scripting support embedded in .podweb pages. No example yet,
but the vision includes hide and show properties which can be triggered by pressing buttons, when time has elapsed or by different Logic. This will allow the implementation of tell tale games using podweb
Lets see where this leads us.
[-p]

[h2] Feature requests by users

[p] - A list tag for bullet point content

[p] - Make all text selectable for copy and paste

[p] - A bookmark function to save favourite pages

[p] - Syntax highlighting support for text editors like strawberry_src

[h2] Known bugs

[p] - none

[comments]

